  "auto.bf4efc1e": "Prison Island",
  "auto.d10bfdaf": "— a short boat trip for snorkeling and resident giant tortoises",
  "auto.417ef9ce": "Kizimkazi dolphin tours",
  "auto.b8a46cc5": "— early-morning boat trips off the south coast",
  "auto.a4a97ec4": "Spice farm tours",
  "auto.5716d412": "— walking tours of working clove, nutmeg, and vanilla plantations",
  "auto.9f0607f9": "Mnemba Island",
  "auto.0c4a0489": "— the island's best reef, a short boat ride from the northeast coast",
  "auto.ee2ee599": "Ask what someone actually wants from their beach days — swimming, diving, nightlife, or quiet — before booking a coastline, not after.",
  "auto.d838517e": "Most of our safari-plus-Zanzibar itineraries pair 3–4 safari days with 4–7 days on one of these coasts. Tell us which of the above sounds like your trip and we'll build the combination around it.",
