  "auto.c3fb7f60": "CALENDAR-DRIVEN, NOT GUARANTEED",
  "auto.edfaffe7": "The Great Migration",
  "auto.69c3f4f0": "Roughly 1.5 million wildebeest and 250,000 zebra circle the Serengeti-Mara ecosystem year-round chasing rainfall — there is no single \"migration season,\" only a rough calendar of where the herds tend to be.",
