  "auto.a40e9c45": "ANSWERS BEFORE YOU ASK",
  "auto.5405d8a9": "Frequently Asked Questions",
  "auto.a4649dde": "Can't find what you need here? Mihayo AI (the chat bubble, bottom-right) can answer most of these instantly, or",
