  "auto.842eb5c1": "Northern Circuit, 6 days",
  "auto.b34a0c04": "We summited via Lemosho and the pacing was exactly right — no altitude issues, no rushing. The porters' welfare is clearly taken seriously here, which mattered to us.",
  "auto.a99dd8c9": "Daniel K.",
  "auto.074dcb13": "Kilimanjaro, Lemosho Route",
  "auto.9d4f6934": "Combined five safari days with a week in Paje. The handover between the two halves of the trip was seamless — same company, one contact person throughout.",
  "auto.f4c82839": "Amara O.",
  "auto.e380997c": "Safari + Zanzibar, 12 days",
  "auto.ea9b893c": "We asked for a slower-paced family itinerary with our two kids and got exactly that — shorter drives, a pool at every stop, and a guide who kept them engaged the whole way.",
  "auto.c8254fee": "Priya S.",
  "auto.a4e6f40a": "Family Safari, 6 days",
