  "auto.0a9a8d55": "Technical Information:",
  "auto.bc5ae504": "We automatically collect information about your device, browser type, IP address, pages visited, and time spent on our website using cookies and similar tracking technologies.",
  "auto.4a7c7fd8": "2. How We Use Your Information",
  "auto.876d757f": "To process bookings and provide safari services",
  "auto.3918f3f9": "To send newsletters, promotional materials, and service updates",
  "auto.b9c938df": "To respond to your inquiries and provide customer support",
  "auto.f8ddb547": "To improve our website and services",
  "auto.2827a4e8": "To comply with legal obligations",
  "auto.2fcd8527": "3. How We Protect Your Information",
  "auto.4fc14ee1": "We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your personal information against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction. However, no method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure.",
  "auto.0219791a": "4. Sharing Your Information",
  "auto.09ab619b": "We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties. We may share information with:",
  "auto.2b52b8ef": "Service providers who assist us in operating our website and services",
  "auto.cc5ef472": "Hotel and accommodation partners when necessary to fulfill your safari bookings",
  "auto.71071bbe": "Legal authorities when required by law",
  "auto.23d9fe3a": "5. Cookies",
  "auto.b25ec454": "Our website uses cookies to enhance your user experience. You can control cookie settings through your browser. Disabling cookies may affect some website functionality.",
  "auto.425b27c9": "6. Third-Party Links",
  "auto.3381dde3": "Our website may contain links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of these external sites. Please review their privacy policies before providing any personal information.",
  "auto.f276a460": "7. Your Rights",
  "auto.0b35f456": "Depending on your location, you may have rights to access, modify, or delete your personal information. To exercise these rights, please contact us at mihayosafaris@gmail.com.",
  "auto.79e51bd7": "8. Changes to This Privacy Policy",
  "auto.91b93d34": "We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page, and your continued use of our website constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.",
